{
  "id": "tfnexfreekey0001",
  "name": "Taifoon example 1a: get a free key and check its tenant",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "tfnexfreekey0001-00",
      "name": "Start",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "f0",
              "name": "wallet_address",
              "value": "0x0000000000000000000000000000000000000000",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "f1",
              "name": "agent_label",
              "value": "n8n:example-1a",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "tfnexfreekey0001-01",
      "name": "Wallet",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        240,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "account",
        "operation": "register",
        "walletAddress": "={{ $json.wallet_address }}",
        "agentLabel": "={{ $json.agent_label }}"
      },
      "id": "tfnexfreekey0001-02",
      "name": "Register Free Key",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-taifoon.taifoon",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        480,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://coord.taifoon.dev/v1/tenant/me",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "X-API-Key",
              "value": "={{ $json.api_key }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "neverError": true
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "tfnexfreekey0001-03",
      "name": "Get My Tenant (new key)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        720,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// The tenant and the key PREFIXES only. The raw keys stay in the Register Free Key output (shown once).\nconst reg = $('Register Free Key').first().json;\nconst me = $json || {};\nconst t = me.tenant || {};\nreturn [{ json: {\n  ok: me.ok === true,\n  tenant_id: t.id || null,\n  tenant_via: t.via || null,\n  wallet_label: t.wallet_label || null,\n  key_prefix: reg.key_prefix || null,\n  keys: (me.keys || []).map((k) => ({ prefix: k.prefix, env: k.env, revoked: Boolean(k.revoked) })),\n  next_step: me.next_step ? (me.next_step.title || me.next_step.id) : null,\n  save_it: 'Copy api_key from the Register Free Key output into Credentials → Taifoon Relayer API now. It is not shown again.',\n} }];"
      },
      "id": "tfnexfreekey0001-04",
      "name": "Summary",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        960,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1a · Get a free key, check the tenant\n\nNo credential needed.\n\n1. Put **your** wallet address in **Wallet** (a label only; nothing is signed).\n2. Execute. **Register Free Key** answers `api_key` + `keys { live, sandbox }` **once**.\n3. Save `api_key` as a **Taifoon Relayer API** credential, then use example **1b**.\n\nFree keys: 3 a day per IP. Successful executions of this workflow are not saved (settings), so the keys do not stay in execution data.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "tfnexfreekey0001-n05",
      "name": "About",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -40
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Start": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Wallet",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Wallet": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Register Free Key",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Register Free Key": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Get My Tenant (new key)",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Get My Tenant (new key)": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Summary",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1",
    "saveDataSuccessExecution": "none",
    "saveManualExecutions": false
  },
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false,
    "taifoon": {
      "package": "n8n-nodes-taifoon",
      "min_version": "0.6.0",
      "ops": [
        "account.register"
      ],
      "description": "Registers a free Taifoon key for a wallet label (no credential needed), reads the new tenant with that key, and returns the tenant and key prefixes only. The keys appear once, in the Register Free Key output; successful runs are not saved."
    }
  },
  "pinData": {},
  "tags": []
}
